- HTTP Status Code:
	- 200 OK
	- 201 Created		: POST worked
	- 204 No Content	: DELETE worked

	- 301 Moved Permanently:	Perma redirect

	- 400 Bad Request			: invalid syntax 
	- 403 Forbiden Access		: No right for this file
	- 404 Not Found				: Unknown file/route
	- 405 Method Not Allowed	: Forbiden method

	- 500 Internal Server Error	: Serv Error
